                <head>No. 52<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Convention on the Settlement of Matters
                        Arising Out of the War and the Occupation</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bonn</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1952-05-26"
                            >May 26, 1952</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">[The text of this convention, including the
                    Charter of the Arbitral Commission on Property, Rights and Interests in Germany
                    which is attached to the convention as an annex, is not printed here. For full
                    text and the annex, see <hi rendition="#italic">Senate Q and R</hi>, pages
                    25–88, or Cmd. 8571, pages 75–135.]</note>
